# GitHub logins who may authorize a labeled tombstone-only rewrite of
# history/social.jsonl (see README.md, "History rewrites").
#
# One login per line. Lines starting with # and blank lines are ignored; any
# other line that is not a bare GitHub login makes the History guard fail. The
# guard reads this file from the BASE commit (main), never from the pull
# request, so a pull request cannot add its own author here and use it.
#
# Empty on purpose: until you add a login, no rewrite is accepted and the guard
# only lets the history file append. Protect this file with CODEOWNERS and
# required review from a second person if you have one.
